/-!
# Proof-carrying fivefold canonical-Society constitution

This consumer proves the canonical-Society contract through existing actual
producers:

* identity is generated by lineage fold and relation phase;
* mandate power and material service are paid renewals, not eternal stock;
* residual liability has a source bearer and independent consumer;
* a classical observer identifies two different actual paths while their
  authority kernels differ;
* every finite law current has exact self-U8 and a generated successor.

The same carrier also separates UBI exit capacity, UBS-style actual material
service and Job-Guarantee role standing by positive producers and typed
non-substitution no-gos.  No second constitution root or completed future is
created.
-/

